PM M223: shards-init with a GPU's runs' device filter loaded before its template is saved,
so that a run given the GPU attaches it without loading it. Applied over D152's init
(`git apply`), built (`cargo build -p shards-init --profile guest --target
aarch64-unknown-linux-musl`) and recorded in one home (`shards guest use --init`), it was
compared with D152's init in another by build-ab/ab.py, `AB_FLAGS="--rm --gpus all"`: the
runs took no less time, and shards does not do it.

